{"id":"vorstellung","lemma":"Vorstellung","pos":"noun","rank":1461,"glosses":["idea, image, representation (the transcript, image, or picture of a visible object that is formed by the mind)","introduction","presentation"],"ipa":"/ˈfoːɐ̯ˌʃtɛlʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b5/De-Vorstellung.oga/De-Vorstellung.oga.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Vorstellung","plural":"Vorstellungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Diese Vorstellung ist mir völlig neu.","en":"This idea is totally new to me.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"completely"},{"g":"new"}]},{"text":"Wissen ist nichts, Vorstellung ist alles.","en":"Knowing is nothing. Imagination is everything.","words":[{"g":"to know"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"nothing"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"everything"}]},{"text":"Sie hatten andere Vorstellungen.","en":"They had different ideas.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"another , others","l":"anderer"},null]},{"text":"Die Vorstellung beginnt bald.","en":"The show will begin soon.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to begin","l":"beginnen"},{"g":"soon"}]},{"text":"Er hat sonderbare Vorstellungen.","en":"He has strange ideas.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"strange, odd","l":"sonderbar"},null]}]}